{"id":"43a8d98c9b5fc94d","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-bimodal-analysis-realization.md","title":"Bimodal Realization in Analysis","display":"df-bimodal-analysis-realization — Bimodal Realization in Analysis","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-bimodal-analysis-realization","aliases":["89-df-bimodal-analysis-realization"],"display":"df-bimodal-analysis-realization — Bimodal Realization in Analysis","depends_on":["[[89-df-bimodal-formula]]","[[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]]","[[89-thm-analysis-omega-completeness]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-bimodal-analysis-realization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-bimodal-analysis-realization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bimodal-analysis-realization — Bimodal Realization in Analysis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6d483dd2c6fd176\" href=\"?note=a6d483dd2c6fd176\" title=\"89-df-bimodal-formula\">89-df-bimodal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"508219e8b4c7dadf\" href=\"?note=508219e8b4c7dadf\" title=\"89-df-analysis-omega-theory\">89-df-analysis-omega-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"571457cbee377421\" href=\"?note=571457cbee377421\" title=\"89-thm-analysis-omega-completeness\">89-thm-analysis-omega-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_2\">\\(r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}_{\\mathrm{An}}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bew}_{\\mathrm{An}}(x)\\)</span> 是分析的标准普通证明谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(x)\">\\(O(x)\\)</span> 是第 14 章固定的完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 可证性表示。</li>\n<li>对二阶算术有限公式固定有效 Gödel 编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\ \\urcorner_2\">\\(\\ulcorner\\ \\urcorner_2\\)</span> 与数词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_2\">\\(\\bot_2\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\ne0\">\\(0\\ne0\\)</span>。这些是原书的明确基础句法接口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bimodal\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_2,\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(p)&amp;\\coloneqq r(p),\\qquad\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\bot_2,\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A),\\qquad\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)\\land\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(B),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\Box_0 A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Bew}_{\\mathrm{An}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)\\urcorner_2}),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\Box_1 A)&amp;\\coloneqq O(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)\\urcorner_2}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bimodal\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_2,\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(p)&amp;\\coloneqq r(p),\\qquad\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\bot_2,\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A),\\qquad\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)\\land\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(B),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\Box_0 A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Bew}_{\\mathrm{An}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)\\urcorner_2}),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\Box_1 A)&amp;\\coloneqq O(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)\\urcorner_2}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 16 章 pp.217–218。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>结构递归覆盖全部构造子并保持闭句，有限树递归给出唯一映射。嵌套盒须对已翻译的整句重新编码。</p>\n<p>这里第二盒是<strong>分析中的完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 闭包</strong>；PA 双模态解释的第二盒是一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 可证性，两个谓词的公式复杂度和基础语言不同，不可直接复用为同一个翻译。二阶句法编码和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> 的内部派生条件沿原书来源接口，未在此从算术基础重新证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-bimodal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a6d483dd2c6fd176","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-bimodal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-analysis-omega-theory","status":"resolved","id":"508219e8b4c7dadf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-analysis-omega-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"571457cbee377421","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-analysis-omega-completeness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bew}_{\\mathrm{An}}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"O(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\ \\urcorner_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline n","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_2","display":false},{"tex":"0\\ne0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bimodal\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r&:\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_2,\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(p)&\\coloneqq r(p),\\qquad\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\bot_2,\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\neg\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A),\\qquad\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)\\land\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(B),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\Box_0 A)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Bew}_{\\mathrm{An}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)\\urcorner_2}),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(\\Box_1 A)&\\coloneqq O(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\tau^{\\mathrm{An}}_r(A)\\urcorner_2}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"O","display":false}],"bytes":2141,"backlinks":[{"id":"bb08f01f5311762f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-bimodal-analysis-realization]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-180","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"分析：[[89-df-bimodal-analysis-realization]] → [[89-thm-glb-analysis-completeness]]。"}],"outgoing":["a6d483dd2c6fd176","508219e8b4c7dadf","571457cbee377421"]}